Here are the two exact fixes to keep the upload icon its standard blue color and to completely remove the background from the success banner while keeping that good text color.
### 1. Fix the Icon Color
Find the CloudUploadIcon inside your activeStep === 0 upload box (around line 400, depending on where it sits in your return block).
**Find this exact line:**
```javascript
                <CloudUploadIcon sx={{ fontSize: "6rem", color: file ? "success.main" : "primary.main", mb: 1 }} />

```
**Replace it with this:**
```javascript
                {/* Changed to strictly stay primary blue even when a file is uploaded */}
                <CloudUploadIcon sx={{ fontSize: "6rem", color: "primary.main", mb: 1 }} />

```
### 2. Remove the Success Banner Background
Scroll down to the batchCreated && (<Alert... block near the bottom of your file.
**Find this exact block:**
```javascript
          {/* NEW: Light, clean, highly visible Success Banner */}
          {batchCreated && (
            <Alert 
              severity="success" 
              sx={{ 
                mt: 3, 
                mx: "auto", 
                maxWidth: "100%", 
                backgroundColor: "#eef7ee", // Very light, soft green background
                color: "#1b5e20",           // Dark, highly visible green text
                border: "1px solid #c8e6c9", // Soft border
                '& .MuiAlert-icon': { color: "#2e7d32" },
                '& .MuiAlert-message': { width: '100%' } 
              }}
            >

```
**Replace it with this to remove the background:**
```javascript
          {/* NEW: Transparent background with clear text */}
          {batchCreated && (
            <Alert 
              severity="success" 
              sx={{ 
                mt: 3, 
                mx: "auto", 
                maxWidth: "100%", 
                backgroundColor: "transparent", // <-- Background removed completely
                color: "#1b5e20",               // Kept the nice dark text
                border: "1px solid #c8e6c9",    // Kept the soft border for structure
                '& .MuiAlert-icon': { color: "#2e7d32" },
                '& .MuiAlert-message': { width: '100%' } 
              }}
            >

```
This will make the success banner blend seamlessly into the white page while keeping the green text and border looking sharp!
